{"eligibility":"include","exclusion_criterion":"","side_list":"none","eligibility_reason":"Abstract describes an LLM agent pipeline (retrieval plus RCI loop with ensemble SAST and unit-test feedback) that produces security-hardened code and reports security and functional outcomes. It is borderline: the inputs may be human-written vulnerable code (EC4/adjacent), and whether the outcomes are quantitative cannot be confirmed from the abstract.","title":"RepoGuard: Harmonising Security and Functional Correctness in LLM-Guided Repository-Level Code Generation","year":2026,"venue":"International Congress on Information and Communication Technology (ICICT)","venue_type":"peer-reviewed-conf","study_type":"technique-proposal","techniques":[{"technique_name":"RepoGuard-Agent (AST context retrieval + prompt-engineered LLM correction + Auto-Importer + SAST/unit-test RCI loop)","family_v0":"hybrid","stage":"post-generation-loop","signal_source":["static-analyzer","test-execution","retrieved-knowledge","self"],"tools":"ensemble SAST scanners (unspecified)","iterations":"RCI iterations until convergence (count NR)","dims_targeted":["security"],"dims_measured":["security"],"correctness_measured":true,"metrics":"security: SAST findings/CWE mitigation [tool-static]; correctness: unit tests [execution]","benchmarks":"synthetic multi-CWE script (1 case)","languages":"NR (likely Python)","models":"NR","baselines":"NR","effect_target":"+","effect_target_headline":"","effect_correctness":"0","effect_correctness_headline":"","effect_other_dims":{"readability-maintainability":"NR","efficiency":"NR","security":"targeted"}}],"compute_reported":["none"],"contamination_handled":"no","human_eval":"none","human_eval_details":"","artifact_url":"","reimplementable":"partial","qa":{"QA1":0.5,"QA2":0,"QA3":0.5,"QA4":1,"QA5":0,"QA6":0,"QA7":0,"QA8":0,"QA9":0,"QA10":0.5},"confidence":"low","notes":"Decided from the abstract only. Check whether the input code is human-written; if so, this is LLM repair of human code and should be excluded as EC4/adjacent. The evaluation is a single synthetic script, so it is unclear whether any quantitative NF outcome exists (IC3). Models and baselines are unknown."}
```

